WEBVTT

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.590
<i>The effects of Hitotsubashi 
Shigeyoshi's rebellion</i>

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:08.760
<i>against the shogunate in distant Edo castle</i>

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:13.530
<i>were about to be felt here 
in Nagasaki, as well.</i>

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:23.430
<i>Things have begun to happen 
around Keiichiro and Kiriko.</i>

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:29.860
Kiriko...

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.640
<b>Dai Shogun</b>

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:48.640
Great Revolution

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.230
<b>Touching</b>

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:12.940
<b>Humping</b>

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:20.700
<b>Episode 7:
The Ninja of Passion, 
the Bloody Shinsengumi!</b>

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.720
Hey, Boss!

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.700
What do you think they're going to do to us?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.580
Something out of this world, I'm sure.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.540
Whoa, seriously?

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:31.800
Hey, we're just here to 
get our hair cut, okay?

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:33.540
Quit grinning like that.

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.960
That's impossible!

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:38.630
I hope they call us soon.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:42.030
Keijiro-san, and Mihyakusuke-san?

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:43.460
Yes?

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:47.550
Keijiro and Mihyakusuke.

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:49.690
You guys look like you're having fun.

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:52.490
What are you doing?

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:55.520
Um, this is...

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.880
Well... W-We're getting a haircut!

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.070
A haircut!

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.410
That's right! We came to get our hair cut!

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.200
Well, if that's the case,

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.960
then I'll lend you a hand.

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:08.070
Yes.

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:10.210
Are you sure you want <i>only</i> your hair cut?

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.540
<b>Cherry Blossom Baths</b>

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:19.050
Hey! Let me go, Kiriko!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:24.800
You must never go back to 
an indecent place like that.

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:28.330
Today, you're going to change your ways.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:31.810
I-It wasn't just me!

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:35.440
He is receiving punishment of his own.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:37.820
Ow, hot!

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:43.040
You sneaked into the boss's 
bed, too, didn't you?

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:44.240
Hot!

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:46.710
I can do what I want.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:48.370
But you can't.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.320
I won't let you betray me.

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:52.720
What kind of logic is that?!

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:56.290
Save me!

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:57.810
No!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.260
Let me have a little fun!

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:07.840
In my seventeen years, I've never 
been touched by a woman!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.620
I want...

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:13.560
I want...!

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:22.190
Then just wait a little longer, 
until the land is at peace.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:27.490
The fate of this country 
rests upon your virginity.

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.830
Jeez...

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.700
I don't know why the curse was broken.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:37.790
I didn't break it so you could 
go after every girl you s—

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.720
Did you say you broke it?

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.100
Does that mean...

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:44.090
No.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:49.100
Does that mean you... k-kissed me?

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:51.920
I d-don't know what you mean!

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:56.020
I-I...

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.920
Let's kiss, Kiriko.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.050
Who are you?

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.450
Who the hell are you?

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.690
S-Sutemaru?

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.810
Sutemaru?

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:44.440
I've come for you, my Kiriko.

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:50.820
Get out! Get out!

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:57.530
It's the middle of the day! 
You should be working!

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:58.490
What's your problem?

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:00.130
He's in a bad mood.

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:11.220
Thank you for coming all the way from Iga.

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:15.470
Not at all. I'm honored to meet you.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:18.840
The story of the legendary ninja, Tomi-sama,

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:22.690
has reached even me, Sutemaru, the prince of Iga.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:25.480
You're an odd one.

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:27.400
I'm sorry.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:32.970
I've come here on business from Iga Village.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:34.530
Oh, yes.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:37.000
How are they doing?

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:43.960
In fact, Shigeyoshi's men recently attacked Iga.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:45.880
What?

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:50.800
I fought with my tightly-sculpted 
body and beautiful ninjitsu,

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.640
but I couldn't protect them all.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:55.180
The people of the village were scattered.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.350
I see.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:00.100
They defeated the veteran Iga ninjas so easily?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:05.320
<b>Loyalty</b>

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:02.830
They called themselves the Shinsengumi.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:05.320
Samurai who pledged themselves to Shigeyoshi.

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:08.910
It is said that they commit brutal murders,

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:14.780
and that their pale blue coats have absorbed 
so much blood, they've turned black.

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:17.400
About six months ago,

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:22.510
a dojo owner named Asai Gen'unsai who 
had sought information on Shigeyoshi

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:24.960
was killed by the Shinsengumi.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:32.400
His arms were severed and he was crucified.

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:38.640
They are strong.

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:43.690
Even I could only manage to 
run away on my swift legs.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.240
I see.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:48.900
So why have you come here, Sutemaru?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.450
Ma'am,

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:55.030
I've come to tell you that the Shinsengumi's 
true objective is Nagasaki,

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.980
and they'll be here soon.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.120
What?

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:04.840
Their goal is to slay Tokugawa Keiichiro-sama,

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:06.690
and to take Susanoo.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:11.800
They attacked Iga because it was on the way.

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:13.800
I see.

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:15.520
In that case...

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:22.560
We must prepare to fight them.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:35.110
Sutemaru.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:36.560
Yes?

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:42.500
You came here for another reason, didn't you?

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.140
I see.

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.310
So young...

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.390
I don't like that guy.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:11.620
But what's that good-looking guy 
with nice hair doing here?

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:12.750
Dunno.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.900
Probably begging for money or something.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.990
You're dense, Kei-chan.

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:22.450
He's an old boyfriend of 
the cold-blooded bitch.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.680
What?

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:24.830
Seriously?

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:28.600
He came to see her specifically.

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:32.800
And from really far away, 
so it must be pretty serious.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.680
What do you want?

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:42.520
I don't have time to talk 
about the past with you.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:43.570
Kiriko,

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.770
would you please abandon Iga?

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:46.640
What?

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:49.560
Iga is gone now.

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.770
Leave this place with me.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:57.700
And you and I can be a 
beautiful couple somewhere!

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:57.700
<b>Beautiful Boy 

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:59.990
Wh-What are you saying?

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.930
We promised to spend our future together!

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.250
Th-That was

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:08.440
just a joke when we were children.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.960
I'm not interested in being with anyone.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.870
Are you still bothered about your brother?

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.960
That wasn't your fault.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.530
My heart is warmer than the spring sun.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.060
I can heal you.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:29.020
I cannot leave Keiichiro-sama's side.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.560
With Iga gone,

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.900
there's no need to do your job anymore.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:39.780
And Keiichiro-sama isn't like us.

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:43.280
No matter how much you may love him,

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.290
one day he'll be far beyond your reach.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:00.590
Sutemaru...

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:02.100
What?

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.100
I have

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:11.660
a favor to ask you.

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:27.490
You want something?

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:31.000
I realized I hadn't introduced 
myself yet, Tokugawa Keiichiro-san.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.830
I am the man who will someday 
be the ultimate ninja.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:36.460
Sutemaru.

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:39.040
I'm told you're going to be Shogun.

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:41.010
I'm willing to be your friend, if you want.

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:43.760
Sorry, but I've already got a ninja.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:47.480
No, Kiriko is leaving you.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.880
She'll be leaving with me before long.

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.640
We'll live together in another land.

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:54.860
Wh-What?

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:58.360
Want to come with me for a bit?

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:01.190
You want a fight, huh?

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:03.620
That's fine by me.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:18.040
If you're a man, then fight me with your fists.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:21.120
I don't know how you've mistaken me,

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:24.010
but I'm not going to get into a brawl with you.

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:27.970
I don't want to taint my fists with your blood.

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.970
What did you say?

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:34.560
How much do you know about Kiriko?

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:35.590
Huh?

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:41.840
Have you ever felt there was 
a tiny thorn within her heart?

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:42.650
Thorn?

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:44.040
Yes.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:49.370
The ancient laws of the ninjas 
are a thorn within her heart.

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:56.400
When she was young, she and her 
brother were brought to Iga Village.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:13:00.010
But the laws did not allow a sister 
and brother who cared for one another

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:02.440
to remain in the village.

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:07.430
When her brother learned this, 
he turned his blade on himself.

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:10.560
Brother! Brother!

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:13.020
Brother!

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:14.990
Don't worry.

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:17.850
You're not alone anymore.

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:20.610
So

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.070
don't cry.

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:28.960
Live well, Kiriko.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:34.660
Brother!

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:42.840
Ever since then, she stopped loving 
other people and closed her heart.

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:48.150
She thought it would be better to love no one,

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.430
than to love someone and lose them again.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:57.060
The Kiriko you know is only 
a fragment of her true self.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:01.150
Can you still love her?

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.450
L-Love her?

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:06.650
You can't answer me?

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.350
Screw you!

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:13.170
I couldn't say something so embarrassing!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:18.060
Can you keep her safe in the battles to come?

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.380
I can save her,

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:29.970
with my heart that is bigger than 
this great sky, this great sea!

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:39.260
What is that?

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:57.450
Kondo-san, was it okay to 
come here without permission?

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:00.510
Don't be stupid, Toshi.

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:03.700
If we bring back Susanoo and Keiichiro's head,

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:06.080
Shigeyoshi-sama isn't going to complain.

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:09.340
And you want to get into a fight, too, right?

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:10.500
Indeed.

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:14.010
I'm tired of fighting weaklings.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.470
Then let's make this quick.

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:28.940
What are you doing? Let me go.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.440
This was Kiriko's request.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:34.660
She wanted you kept away from the baths.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.090
What?

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:39.120
I'm just supposed to sit here 
and watch them attack?

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:42.080
I don't want to do this, myself.

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:46.390
But Kiriko is ready to sacrifice 
her life to protect you.

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:48.840
It's better that you not be there.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.600
Hell no!

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:52.840
Screw you!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:07.730
I'm... I'm not the kind of guy who can 
watch someone else get hurt for his sake,

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:10.820
no matter what she says.

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:22.790
Are you the Shinsengumi?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.420
Who are you?

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:25.750
She's cute.

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:29.500
That's Keiichiro's babysitter. 
Houkouin mentioned her.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.010
What?

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:33.430
Begone.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:35.010
I won't let you

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.640
take another step.

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:42.270
You want to fight?

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:46.100
I'll rip you apart!

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:48.480
Wait!

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:50.300
Hyogo-dono!

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:51.940
They are my prey.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:53.700
Who the hell are you?

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:56.720
I am the daughter of Asai Gen'unsai,

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:58.260
Asai Hyogo.

00:16:58.260 --> 00:17:02.120
I have to come to avenge my father!

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.080
Prepare to die, Shinsengumi!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.210
Asai?

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.320
Who's that?

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:08.050
Kon-chan, you think it's that guy?

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:09.790
The guy at the tiny dojo.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:12.340
Oh, the crazy old geezer?

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:16.210
I can't remember the name of 
every single person I killed.

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:19.680
He wasn't even worth drawing our blades for.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.850
You bastards!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.980
A girl in men's clothing?

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.230
I don't like that.

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:41.410
Is that all you've got?

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:44.080
Iga ninjas are so damn slow!

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:50.820
Tying up girls isn't my thing...

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:56.300
Kiriko-dono!

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:06.000
A girl should be quiet and meek.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:19.450
I'm the leader of the Shinsengumi. 
Don't underestimate me,

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.370
Tokugawa Keiichiro.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.870
I'm in the middle of cutting 
off your babysitter's head.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:29.080
If you want to save her, 
then call your Onigami!

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.920
Keiichiro-sama, you mustn't!

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:41.440
What's that?

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:42.550
What's going on?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.420
There it is!

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:59.240
Shigeyoshi-sama, this thing's amazing.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:00.360
Soji!

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.610
Let's get ours, too!

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:05.760
Our game is over.

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:24.970
Two of them?

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.180
Susanoo!

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.730
They killed my father!

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:33.860
Please! Let me fight with you!

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:35.610
Please!

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.120
Let's go!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.160
Yeah!

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.470
<b>Susanoo Light Flash Wind God</b>

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:08.430
Let go of Kiriko.

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:10.850
That's not happening!

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:13.770
Kill the girl, Soji!

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:16.870
Who are you?

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:18.170
Stop!

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:22.990
We finally meet, my beautiful vixen.

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:25.510
Let me go.

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:27.830
I don't know who you ar—

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.580
Toshi! Hii-chan!

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:37.720
Sutemaru...

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:39.430
I slipped her a drug.

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:43.630
It's fair after what she did to my village.

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:46.260
Keiichiro-sama, give them 
heaven's punishment!

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.300
Here I go!

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:50.330
Stupid kid...

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.680
Don't get cocky!

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:57.310
Fine, let's finish this.

00:20:57.840 --> 00:21:00.530
Keiichiro, she's fast.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:03.690
Keep your eyes open and follow 
the swing of her blade!

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:04.650
Right!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.340
That hurt!

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:29.880
Yeah! How'd you like that?!

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:33.260
You defiled my father's body.

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:37.060
My revenge will not end until 
you've paid for that crime.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:49.130
We'll get you for this!

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:11.390
You're leaving without telling her?

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:16.060
I've got more female ninjas than I can 
count waiting for me besides Kiriko.

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:18.230
It's hard being popular.

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:21.380
I heard about your village from Grannie.

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:23.610
If you've got nowhere to stay...

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:24.900
Keiichiro-sama.

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:29.200
Kiriko was a crybaby when she was young.

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:34.400
She would always follow along 
behind me and never leave.

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:38.170
So she's always been pushy.

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:43.210
Yeah, but it looks like she's 
not interested in me anymore.

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:50.550
While she watched you in that last fight, 
she wasn't the Kiriko I used to know.

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:55.720
I was the one who didn't understand her.

00:22:56.410 --> 00:23:00.100
I'll ask you again. Do you love Kiriko?

00:23:02.630 --> 00:23:04.070
I...

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:09.990
A love so great, you can't put it into words?

00:23:11.610 --> 00:23:12.870
Farewell!

00:23:25.760 --> 00:23:28.410
Chiharu-san! There's a crazy 
guy who's come to the baths!

00:23:28.410 --> 00:23:29.860
Another childhood friend?

00:23:29.860 --> 00:23:31.200
This time, it's some smug old guy.

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:33.220
And he came in armed with 
nothing but his fists!

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:35.070
I like it! Manly!

00:23:35.070 --> 00:23:37.350
Next time, a strip rock-paper-scissors 
battle to decide the fate of Japan!

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Time: 
Dejima Dawn, The Greatest Fist in Japan!</b>

00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:38.700
That's what you meant by "fist"?
